<title>SWITZERLAND: BADMINTON-SWISS OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-SWISS OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results late on Friday at the Swiss Open badminton championships (prefix denotes seeding)</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>1-Poul-Erik Hoyer-Larsen (Denmark) beat 5/8-Park Sung-woo (South Korea) 17-18 15-9 15-12</p>
<p>3/4-Sun Jun (China) beat Indra Wijaya (Indonesia) 12-15 15-11 15-1</p>
<p>9/16-Dong Jiong (China) beat 5/8-Peter Gade (Denmark) 15-8 15-7</p>
<p>Peter Rasmussen (Denmark) beat 5/8-Allan Budi Kusuma 17-14 15-5</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>1-Camilla Martin (Denmark) beat 5/8-Kim Ji-hyun (South Korea) 11-3 8-11 11-6</p>
<p>5/8-Lee Joo-hyun (South Korea) beat 3/4-Chen Wang (China) 11-8 11-6</p>
<p>3/4-Susi Susanti (Indonesia) beat 5/8-Han Jingna (China) 11-1 11-7</p>
<p>2-Ye Zhaoying (China) beat Mette Sorensen (Denmark) 11-6 11-1</p>
</text>
